&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win new logos.&lt;/strong&gt; Run fast, consultative sales cycles from discovery to close and win competitive evaluations against other payments providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell the right solution from the start.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand each founder’s business model and position the right Stripe Connect integration and payments monetisation strategy so that new platforms are set up to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close and activate.&lt;/strong&gt; Negotiate and close deals, then work with Solutions Architects, Product, Risk, and Operations to get new platforms live quickly. You’ll be measured on new business won and activated.&lt;/li&gt;
