&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dedicated and enthusiastic candidate to provide exceptional Customer Service support to the Airbnb community as a &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Support Specialist, Premium Support&lt;/span&gt;. The ideal candidate is hospitable, analytical, and committed to delivering the highest standards of service in both English and French, spoken and written. This is a full time position based in Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
