&lt;li&gt;2–4+ years of experience in a new-business sales role, such as a closing AE, or an SDR/BDR role with a track record of progression and pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of meeting or exceeding new-business targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prospecting skills, with experience building your own pipeline through outbound and inbound&lt;/li&gt;
