&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer platforms and infrastructure as Code(IaC) tools such as CLI, APIs,Terraform or cloud provider tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products for AI agents, such as MCP servers, agent skills, or AI coding tool integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with self-serve growth, developer onboarding, or usage-based pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across cloud and local development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
