&lt;li&gt;Inspired by building systems that manage infrastructure at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approachable, curious, and intellectually honest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and communicate effectively across multiple teams, locally &amp;amp; remote across timezones, internally and externally as required, to drive projects to completion&lt;/li&gt;
