&lt;li&gt;Build new reports and metrics end to end, from the query to the API to the page and the export, working with Product and Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and fix data discrepancies raised by customers and support, digging through code, logs and data to find the root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own correctness: cover report logic with automated tests and add the monitoring and alerts that catch regressions before customers do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance and reliability of report generation as data volume and customer size grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the agentic framework to be more complete and accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling as a genuine part of your workflow, not an afterthought&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software development, building backend or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Kotlin, Java or another object-oriented language, with solid instincts around testing and code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analytics skills, and comfort reasoning about how data is aggregated and why two numbers don&#39;t match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating production services: observability, debugging incidents, and safe rollouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to take an ambiguous problem, break it down and drive it to completion with little oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and problem-solving skills, and curiosity to learn the restaurant domain&lt;/li&gt;
